#  Version Control Rules 

# 1. Allow all results from Vehicle-Speed-from-Audio-SE-ResNet
!Vehicle-Speed-from-Audio-SE-ResNet/results/
!Vehicle-Speed-from-Audio-SE-ResNet/results/**/*.csv
!Vehicle-Speed-from-Audio-SE-ResNet/results/**/*.txt
!Vehicle-Speed-from-Audio-SE-ResNet/results/**/*.md

# 2. Exclude all generated results/outputs from DopplerSim
DopplerSim/static/batch_outputs/
DopplerSim/outputs/
DopplerSim/graphs/
DopplerSim/**/*.csv
DopplerSim/**/*.png
DopplerSim/**/*.wav

# 3. Exclude metadata files for both submodules
*metadata*.json
metadata.json
